<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-115.3-weights-and-measures-compliance-and-analytics" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3633" name="W3633. DTI Weights &amp; Measures Compliance &amp; Inspection" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Statutory verification cycle (W3625/W3626/W3629); DTI inspection; new legal-for-trade device
Frequency: Statutory cycle + on inspection
Volume: Legal-for-trade measuring devices across 200 stores + 4 DCs
Owner: Metrology Manager / Compliance
Participants: Metrology Manager, Compliance/Regulatory (links to VS-22), Quality (links to VS-31), Store/DC Operations, DTI-BPS Inspector/Authorized Verifier, Legal (links to VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W3633 — DTI Weights &amp; Measures Compliance &amp; Inspection</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3633_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3633_Lane1" name="Metrology Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3633_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3633_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3633_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3633_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3633_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3633_Start3" name="Statutory verification cycle (W3625/W3626/W3629); DTI inspection; new legal-for-trade…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3633_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3633_Task4" name="Metrology Manager/Compliance maintain the legal-for-trade device register and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Metrology Manager/Compliance maintain the legal-for-trade device register and statutory calendar: every POS scale, catch-weight scale, and weighbridge used in commerce, the verification/seal expiry, the DTI RDO jurisdiction, and the authorized verifier; ensure all commerce devices are verified/sealed (Consumer Act RA 7394, Fair Trade Law)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Compliance
Accountable (A): Quality Manager / VP Legal
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3633_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3633_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3633_Task5" name="Metrology Manager/Compliance coordinate statutory verification by DTI or an…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Metrology Manager/Compliance coordinate statutory verification by DTI or an authorized verifier: schedule, witness/perform verification, secure the seal/sticker and certificate, record in the register (links to W3620/W3624), and manage re-verification on device change/move/repair; manage DTI inspections and findings
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Compliance / Verifier
Accountable (A): Quality Manager / VP Legal
Duration: Per cycle + inspection</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3633_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3633_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3633_Task6" name="Metrology Manager/Compliance manage DTI inspection response and findings (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Metrology Manager/Compliance manage DTI inspection response and findings (links to VS-22/W77-style regulatory response): non-compliance (unsealed/expired device, tampered seal), corrective action, penalty management, and consumer-complaint defense; report DTI weights &amp; measures compliance to governance (W3640) and audit (links to VS-21)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Compliance / Legal
Accountable (A): Quality Manager / VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3633_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3633_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3633_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3633_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-145 (ensure measurement traceability &amp; weights-and-measures compliance.) | - operational: statutory calendar; operational: closure tracking
Owner: Metrology Manager / Compliance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3633_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3633_Annotation8" targetRef="W3633_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3633_Flow10" sourceRef="W3633_Start3" targetRef="W3633_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3633_Flow11" sourceRef="W3633_Task4" targetRef="W3633_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3633_Flow12" sourceRef="W3633_Task5" targetRef="W3633_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3633_Flow13" sourceRef="W3633_Task6" targetRef="W3633_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3633_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3633_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3633">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3633_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3633_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3633_Task4_di" bpmnElement="W3633_Task4"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3633_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W3633_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3633_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W3633_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3633_Start3_di" bpmnElement="W3633_Start3"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3633_End7_di" bpmnElement="W3633_End7"><dc:Bounds x="1050" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3633_Annotation8_di" bpmnElement="W3633_Annotation8"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="290" width="360" height="60" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3633_Flow10_di" bpmnElement="W3633_Flow10"><di:waypoint x="326" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="400" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3633_Flow11_di" bpmnElement="W3633_Flow11"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3633_Flow12_di" bpmnElement="W3633_Flow12"><di:waypoint x="790" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3633_Flow13_di" bpmnElement="W3633_Flow13"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="1050" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3633_Assoc9_di" bpmnElement="W3633_Assoc9"><di:waypoint x="340" y="290" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3634" name="W3634. Out-of-Tolerance Investigation &amp; Measurement Correction" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: OOT detected during calibration (W3622/W3625–W3632); customer/inventory discrepancy
Frequency: Per OOT event
Volume: OOT events across the device estate
Owner: Metrology Manager
Participants: Metrology Manager, Quality (links to VS-31), Device Owners (Stores/DC/Services), Finance (links to VS-17), Compliance (links to VS-22), Audit (links to VS-21), IT (links to VS-27)
Source: workflow W3634 — Out-of-Tolerance Investigation &amp; Measurement Correction</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3634_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3634_Lane1" name="Metrology Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3634_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3634_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3634_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3634_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3634_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3634_Start3" name="OOT detected during calibration (W3622/W3625–W3632); customer/inventory discrepancy">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3634_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3634_Task4" name="Metrology Manager quarantine the OOT device: remove from…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Metrology Manager quarantine the OOT device: remove from legal-for-trade/commerce service, label out-of-service, swap with a calibrated spare (links to W3636), and prevent further use until corrected; preserve as-found state and notify the device owner and quality
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Device Owner
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Immediate</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3634_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3634_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3634_Task5" name="Metrology Manager investigate the OOT root cause: device failure, drift…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Metrology Manager investigate the OOT root cause: device failure, drift, damage, environmental, misuse, or standard error (links to W3618); assess the measurement impact window (since last-known-good calibration) and the population of affected transactions/records (revenue, inventory, quality acceptances links to W3635)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Quality / Audit
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Per OOT</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3634_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3634_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3634_Task6" name="Metrology Manager/Finance manage the measurement correction…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Metrology Manager/Finance manage the measurement correction: correct/recalibrate or repair the device (W3636), assess and process revenue/AR corrections for under/over-charge (links to VS-16/VS-17), inventory corrections (links to VS-05), and quality re-inspection; document the OOT and correction (W3624), and feed prevention to intervals/training/device design (W3619/W3623); report to governance (W3640)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Finance / Quality
Accountable (A): Quality Manager / CFO
Duration: Per OOT</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3634_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3634_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3634_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3634_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-576 (ensure controlled execution — Weights &amp; Measures Compliance, MRM &amp; Measurement Analytics (PA-115.3).) | - operational: calibration cadence and variance monitoring (W3635); operational: impact-window analysis
Owner: Metrology Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3634_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3634_Annotation8" targetRef="W3634_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3634_Flow10" sourceRef="W3634_Start3" targetRef="W3634_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3634_Flow11" sourceRef="W3634_Task4" targetRef="W3634_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3634_Flow12" sourceRef="W3634_Task5" targetRef="W3634_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3634_Flow13" sourceRef="W3634_Task6" targetRef="W3634_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3634_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3634_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3634">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3634_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3634_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3634_Task4_di" bpmnElement="W3634_Task4"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3634_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W3634_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3634_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W3634_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3634_Start3_di" bpmnElement="W3634_Start3"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3634_End7_di" bpmnElement="W3634_End7"><dc:Bounds x="1050" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3634_Annotation8_di" bpmnElement="W3634_Annotation8"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="290" width="360" height="72" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3634_Flow10_di" bpmnElement="W3634_Flow10"><di:waypoint x="326" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="400" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3634_Flow11_di" bpmnElement="W3634_Flow11"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3634_Flow12_di" bpmnElement="W3634_Flow12"><di:waypoint x="790" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3634_Flow13_di" bpmnElement="W3634_Flow13"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="1050" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3634_Assoc9_di" bpmnElement="W3634_Assoc9"><di:waypoint x="340" y="290" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3635" name="W3635. Measurement Variance, Revenue Impact &amp; Loss Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly analytics cycle; OOT (W3634); variance threshold
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Measurement-variance and revenue-impact data
Owner: Metrology Manager / BI-Finance
Participants: Metrology Manager, BI (links to VS-28.1), Finance/FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), Quality (links to VS-31), Loss Prevention (links to VS-23), Store/DC Operations, ExCo (links to VS-33.2)
Source: workflow W3635 — Measurement Variance, Revenue Impact &amp; Loss Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3635_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3635_Lane1" name="Metrology Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3635_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3635_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3635_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3635_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3635_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3635_Start3" name="Monthly/quarterly analytics cycle; OOT (W3634); variance threshold">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3635_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3635_Task4" name="Metrology Manager/BI instrument measurement-variance metrics: scale-transaction…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Metrology Manager/BI instrument measurement-variance metrics: scale-transaction variance (expected vs. actual weight/charge on catch-weight), cut-length variance/yield, paint-dose variance, weighbridge inbound/outbound variance, fuel variance (links to VS-61), and inventory-count variance attributable to measurement; identify outliers and drift
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / BI
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3635_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3635_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3635_Task5" name="Metrology Manager/Finance quantify the revenue/cost impact: under-charge…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Metrology Manager/Finance quantify the revenue/cost impact: under-charge revenue leakage on catch-weight (POS scale reading low), over-issue material/yield loss (cutting/paint/dispensing), inventory inaccuracy cost (links to VS-05), and quality cost (false accept/reject); model the value-at-risk by device class
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Finance / BI
Accountable (A): Quality Manager / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3635_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3635_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3635_Task6" name="Metrology Manager publish the measurement-variance and impact analytics to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Metrology Manager publish the measurement-variance and impact analytics to executives (links to VS-33.2) and governance (W3640), feed high-impact devices to calibration priority and OOT investigation (W3634), and track reduction over time; coordinate with Loss Prevention on measurement-driven shrink (links to VS-23)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / BI / Finance
Accountable (A): Quality Manager / COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3635_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3635_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3635_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3635_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-576 (ensure controlled execution — Weights &amp; Measures Compliance, MRM &amp; Measurement Analytics (PA-115.3).) | - operational: variance analytics and impact modeling; operational: value-at-risk ranking
Owner: Metrology Manager / BI-Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3635_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3635_Annotation8" targetRef="W3635_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3635_Flow10" sourceRef="W3635_Start3" targetRef="W3635_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3635_Flow11" sourceRef="W3635_Task4" targetRef="W3635_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3635_Flow12" sourceRef="W3635_Task5" targetRef="W3635_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3635_Flow13" sourceRef="W3635_Task6" targetRef="W3635_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3635_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3635_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3635">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3635_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3635_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
