    <bpmn:process id="W_W3637" name="W3637. Calibration Cost, Outsourcing &amp; Service-Level Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual budget cycle (links to VS-33.1); quarterly analytics; outsourcing review
Frequency: Annual + quarterly
Volume: Calibration program cost and service
Owner: Metrology Manager / Finance
Participants: Metrology Manager, Finance/FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), Procurement (links to VS-34), Quality (links to VS-31), External Labs (W3621), BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3637 — Calibration Cost, Outsourcing &amp; Service-Level Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
