    <bpmn:process id="W_W3640" name="W3640. Metrology Maturity, Continuous Improvement &amp; Innovation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual cycle; strategy refresh (W3617); audit; technology opportunity
Frequency: Annual + on opportunity
Volume: Metrology program and landscape
Owner: Metrology Manager
Participants: Metrology Manager, Quality (links to VS-31), Audit (links to VS-21), Innovation (links to VS-30), IT (links to VS-27), Finance (links to VS-17.4), ExCo (links to VS-33.2), Compliance (links to VS-22)
Source: workflow W3640 — Metrology Maturity, Continuous Improvement &amp; Innovation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3640_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3640_Lane1" name="Metrology Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3640_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3640_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3640_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3640_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3640_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3640_Start3" name="Annual cycle; strategy refresh (W3617); audit; technology opportunity">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3640_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3640_Task4" name="Metrology Manager/Audit assess metrology maturity: program governance (W3617)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Metrology Manager/Audit assess metrology maturity: program governance (W3617), traceability integrity (W3618), interval optimization (W3619), registry completeness (W3620), calibration currency/OOT rate (W3622/W3634), MSA coverage (W3638), regulatory compliance (W3633), cost-effectiveness (W3637), and analytics maturity (W3635); benchmark to good practice
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Audit
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3640_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3640_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3640_Task5" name="Metrology Manager identify improvements and innovation: automated/connected…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Metrology Manager identify improvements and innovation: automated/connected calibration (IoT-connected scales self-reporting drift), digital calibration certificates, predictive calibration (usage/condition-based), self-service store calibration for simple devices, and measurement-analytics integration (links to VS-28/VS-30); prioritize and resource via the PMO (links to VS-112)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Innovation / IT
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Annual + on opportunity</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3640_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3640_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3640_Task6" name="Metrology Manager report metrology maturity, improvement progress, and value to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Metrology Manager report metrology maturity, improvement progress, and value to ExCo (links to VS-33.2) and governance, and feed learnings to program strategy (W3617), standards (W3618), intervals (W3619), and training (W3623); drive continuous improvement
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager
Accountable (A): Quality Manager / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3640_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3640_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3640_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3640_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-576 (ensure controlled execution — Weights &amp; Measures Compliance, MRM &amp; Measurement Analytics (PA-115.3).) | - operational: innovation and connected/predictive approaches; operational: independent audit input
Owner: Metrology Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
